abstract: >-
  Reproducibility code for the scenario-based stochastic stress tests
  associated with the manuscript "Governing Agentic AI Under Deep
  Uncertainty: Scenario-Based Stress Tests of Institutional Containment."
  The experiment evaluates downstream institutional containment across
  four five-cell governance topologies while varying propagation pressure,
  mediation delay, and episode-level non-detection. The repository supports
  analysis of cross-cell leakage, systemic contagion, strategic velocity,
  propagated exposure, compromised execution persistence, and the
  bounded-leakage gap. The simulation is a structured design experiment
  and is not calibrated to empirical frequencies of real-world agentic-AI
  incidents.
